# Compositor geometry

Offscreen QtTest honors `setGeometry` position; Wayland/KWin often does not. Those tests are not proof the OS **host window** moved.

After map: place panels from `mapToGlobal(0,0)`, never from a requested bbox origin. Main title-bar drag is `QWindow::startSystemMove` on the host. Child drags move that panel in host-local space and may resize the host.

```text
❌ BAD: setGeometry(union origin) then locals from the requested origin; offscreen green → ship
✅ GOOD: main → startSystemMove; children → move the widget; assert siblings without requiring the toplevel origin to move
```
